// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_BattleMaiden 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1731038261" "Battle Maiden receives her powers from her halberd, a nanite-infested weapon from Warrior Earth. She has amassed a small army of warriors from that dimension as her personal guard."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P224831530" "Battle Maiden"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3961663815" "The first thing that is taught to the Champions of War Earth is that you must always respect those who fall in battle. It does not matter if they are your comrades or your enemy, all those who give their lives to combat must be remembered."
// DisplayNames :
"P2110013139" "Champion of Mourning"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2734080190" "To defeat the enemy in front of you and take the battle is the second lesson of the Champions of War Earth. They believe that if you cannot hold your place in the line then not only will you fall, but so will your comrades around you."
// DisplayNames :
"P14160438" "Champion of Battle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Lieutenant_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1624005519" "The final lesson of the Champions of War Earth is that you must consider each action in terms of the larger picture. If you sacrifice too much to win one battle then you may lose the war. The highest rank of the Champions is always filled with master strategists."
// DisplayNames :
"P1751365495" "Champion of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Nictus_Hunter_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1577106679" "Quantum Champion of Mourning"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1381204262" "Quantum Champion of Battle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BattleMaiden_Nictus_Hunter_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4062932782" "Quantum Champion of War"

