// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_BlackSwan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1355655770" "Black Swan was born with a connection to the Netherworld. Somehow she was able to manufacture an entire dimension, giving her a huge source of power, a place called Shadow Earth."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P2927505880" "Black Swan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1532219686" "These small shadowy beings serve Black Swan loyally. They seem to have no desires or motivations of their own. Some people say that after they encounter them they experience a chill for up to several weeks. They can channel dark energy into focused blasts."
// DisplayNames :
"P1352936371" "Minor Shadow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P474892309" "Although there are no clear visible differences between these minions and the Minor Shadows, it is obvious that they can draw on a greater reserve of power. Something about their essence makes them stronger. It is uncertain where that energy comes from but the most popular theory is that they are created with a more direct connection to Shadow Earth."
// DisplayNames :
"P1926924059" "Shadow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3691698794" "These servants of Black Swan are obviously different in both size and power from their smaller counterparts. They have achieved a mastery of Shadow energy that can only be surpassed by the dark lady herself."
// DisplayNames :
"P711248642" "Master Shadow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_P_Endgame_BlackSwan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_NightWard_BlackSwan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_NightWard_BlackSwan_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_Portal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2714865254" "This tear in reality links Praetorian Earth to the raw nether power of Black Swan's home."
// DisplayNames :
"P3213301016" "Shadow Rift"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_Minion_Portal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BlackSwan_Burn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4116755002" "Burn"

