// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Chimera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1722042947" "Known in Praetoria as Praetor Sinclair, he is Emperor Cole's ultimate assassin. When his parents were killed by Doppelganger, Justin Sinclair was given the opportunity of a lifetime. Doppelganger took the boy under his wing and trained him to be the world's premier silent killer."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P3089161593" "Chimera"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_P_Endgame_Chimera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3138576736" "These low rank servants of Chimera have only the most rudimentary skills with poison. They can create a toxin that will slowly damage their target but is almost never fatal unless combined with other attacks."
// DisplayNames :
"P4174023196" "Cockatrice"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2363991968" "As Chimera's servants advance through the ranks they continue their mastery of weapons and poisons. The Basilisks coat their weapons with a poison that will dull their enemies' reflexes and make them easier to finish off."
// DisplayNames :
"P3528137994" "Basilisk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P988686722" "These combatants are among the most feared that the Praetorians can field. Their weapons are coated with a poison that will paralyze their opponents. This allows them to easily capture or defeat them at their leisure."
// DisplayNames :
"P2084369774" "Gorgon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Nictus_Hunter_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3225746127" "Cockatrice Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P241334793" "Basilisk Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_Nictus_Hunter_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3015450806" "Gorgon Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_RainofArrows_Visual 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// GroupDescription :
"P1664484399" "Archery"
// DisplayNames :
"P176489045" "Rain of Arrows"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Chimera_RainofArrows_Chimera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

