// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Dominatrix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1486236338" "Being the powered grand-daughter of Emperor Cole has its perks. Praetor Duncan trains new Powers Division recruits while at the same time stringing Anti-Matter along, as if he ever had a chance to be with a woman of her stature."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P2422410067" "Dominatrix"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Dominatrix_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3377574802" "To be bound to Dominatrix is an honor that must be earned. Going without sleep and other trials of endurance are given to candidates to prove their worth. Passing means a term of servitude where complete obedience is expected."
// DisplayNames :
"P4281183305" "Servant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3464287763" "Trainers are very important to Dominatrix's organization. They teach the new Servants to fight effectively and work as a unit. They also fill the position of tactical leader in combat quite often."
// DisplayNames :
"P178794940" "Trainer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1283744673" "The Lady is the mistress of all she surveys. She is responsible for a number of Trainers and Servants. There is a strong bond of fealty that goes both ways in these relationships. With power comes responsibility."
// DisplayNames :
"P2447113909" "Lady"

