// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Malaise 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2799035190" "On Praetorian Earth the villain Malaise was never counseled by Sister Psyche, instead he was one of the 'patients' at one of Mother Mayhem's facilities. With the ability to control his madness and inflict it on others, he quickly rose to a position as her favorite."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P1792372749" "Malaise"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Malaise_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2821967657" "It seems that Azuria's spell to return Sister Psyche to her own body has had unexpected effects. Sister Psyche's mental hold over her protogee, Malaise, has been broken. Malaise is a villain once more!"
// GroupDescription :
"P3666629215" "Malaise"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Minion_Knife 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2898588163" "Malaise has the mutant ability to project his insanity into the minds of others. He has slowly adapted to his altered version of reality but the instantaneous placement of his skewed view upon others drives them mad."
// DisplayNames :
"P3247079272" "Crazy Slicer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Minion_Knife_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Minion_Axe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P23898764" "Crazy Chopper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Minion_Axe_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2255834947" "Most of the people affected by Malaise never recover. They certainly don't without help. No one has been able to detect a pattern in those he infects, but once they enter the world that exists in his mind they are never the same."
// DisplayNames :
"P2679367034" "Lunatic Slugger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Lieutenant_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malaise_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P310036100" "Some of those affected by Malaise's insidious powers attain some modicum of control again. They also see the world the way he sees it. These poor creatures become his most trusted servants. Some believe that if enough of them are created the world might turn into the topsy-turvy madhouse that Malaise sees everyday."
// DisplayNames :
"P1514258637" "Maniac Slammer"

