"P3121563534" "After he was defeated, Malaise's mind fractured, leaving him a shell of his former self. This fracturing weakened him enough to fall under Shalice Tilman's control. Now, after being expelled from Penelope Yin and Aurora Borealis, she has fully merged with Malaise in a desperate effort to remain connected to the Seer Network while she tries to regroup."
// DisplayNames :
"P2486040544" "Mother Malaise"

