// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_MotherMayhem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2379560507" "Shalice Tilman, also known as Mother, is the Praetor of Health in Praetoria. She is the pioneer behind the revolutionary Seer Project, which ensures the safety and well being of all Praetorians by monitoring the people's thoughts through a network of psychics. Tilman herself is regarded as the most powerful psychic in the world after having joined her consciousness with that of Aurora Borealis. Both women now inhabit Aurora's body and have combined their powers to do far more for Praetoria together than they ever could apart."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P754644444" "Mother Mayhem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1202239815" "Mother Mayhem places promising patients in her special facilities and then stimulates their rage centers until they are primed killers. She then overlays clear commands directly into their minds and turns them loose. They can't be bargained with, they can't be reasoned with and they absolutely will not stop...ever."
// DisplayNames :
"P3190406001" "Child of Anger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Minion_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P452328510" "Mother Mayhem continues to prod her minions, pushing them farther and farther down a very particular path of madness. Once they are to this level they no longer feel pity, or remorse, or fear...only rage."
// DisplayNames :
"P1680977514" "Child of Rage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Lieutenant_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1693713758" "At this point Mother Mayhem has pushed her 'children' to the point that they can feel nothing but hatred for everything around them. They simply want everything around them to die."
// DisplayNames :
"P1148726742" "Child of Hatred"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Nictus_Hunter_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3269272966" "Child of Anger Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Nictus_Hunter_Minion_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4197080220" "Child of Rage Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Nictus_Hunter_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P723196859" "Child of Hatred Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Nictus_Hunter_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_MotherMayhem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P461734516" "This twisted psion is Tyrants closest advisor and possibly his biggest threat as well. She is organized and has large numbers of minions she has driven to her particular brand of insanity in her special asylums."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_MotherMayhem_Tall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_ShaliceTilman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P323810854" "The disembodied mind of Shalice Tilman has been chased out of the body she was inhabiting and is susceptible to death. Her will is the only thing keeping her alive at this point."
// DisplayNames :
"P3432834590" "Shalice Tilman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_ShaliceTilman_Final 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2889040102" "Shalice Tilman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_AuroraBorealis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1313383001" "Aurora Borealis has been inhabited by the mind of Shalice Tilman for so long that separating the two is very difficult."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_AuroraBorealis_Phase 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_PenelopeYin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3326170267" "Penelope Yin was only recently inhabited by the mind of Shalice Tilman and it shows. Penelope is so personally powerful that she continues to struggle against the control of an Incarnate empowered Shalice Tilman, creating a monstrous psychic storm which shows no signs of abating."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_P_MotherYin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2752082997" "Penelope Mayhem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MotherMayhem_Clone_MN_IDF_Trooper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1531160564" "This is Mother Mayhem, isn't it? Maybe its just some unfortunate citizen whose mind has been taken over Shalice Tilman as she stretches her control over the whole world? In the psychic nightmare of the Seer Network, it's hard to tell what is real and what isn't."
// DisplayNames :
"P2013985415" "Mother Mayhem"

